{"headword":"נָטַר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. keep</strong> (less common ‖ of <span dir=\"rtl\">נָצַר</span>) <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">נְטַר</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܛܰܪ</span> <em>id.;</em> Nab. in n.pr. Lzb<sup>323</sup> (cf. also infr.), Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نَطَرَ</span> <em>id.</em> (obj. garden, etc.)<strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָטָ֑רְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.6\">Ct 1:6</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִטּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:9\" href=\"/Psalms.103.9\">ψ 103:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִנְטוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.5\">Je 3:5</a>; read <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטֹּר</span> also <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:11\" href=\"/Amos.1.11\">Am 1:11</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">יִטְרֹף</span>) Ol <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:9\" href=\"/Psalms.103.9\">ψ 103:9</a> We Now GASm Dr; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּטֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.18\">Lv 19:18</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶטּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.12\">Je 3:12</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹטֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:2\" href=\"/Nahum.1.2\">Na 1:2</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֹטֵרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.6\">Ct 1:6</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֹטְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.11\">Ct 8:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.12\">12</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>keep, maintain</em> (sc. wrath), of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.5\">Je 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:2\" href=\"/Nahum.1.2\">Na 1:2</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <em>for</em>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:9\" href=\"/Psalms.103.9\">ψ 103:9</a>; of Edom <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:11\" href=\"/Amos.1.11\">Am 1:11</a> (reading <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטֹּר לָעַד אַפּוֹ</span> <em>and he kept his anger perpetually</em>, v. supr.), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.18\">Lv 19:18</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">את</span> <em>with</em>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>keep, guard</em> a vineyard <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.6\">Ct 1:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (in fig.), abs. <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.11\">8:11</a>, obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּרְיוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.12\">12</a>."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"}]},"rid":"BDB06285","strong_numbers":["5201"],"next_hw":"מַטָּרָה","prev_hw":"נְטֹפָתִי","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["5757","5758"],"TWOT":["1356"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}